# NDT4 CSS

Follow [CSS Layers](https://webtheme.nd.edu/?path=/docs/foundation-css-layers--docs), [Colors](https://webtheme.nd.edu/?path=/docs/foundation-colors--docs), [Breakpoints](https://webtheme.nd.edu/?path=/docs/foundation-responsive-breakpoints--docs), and [Animations](https://webtheme.nd.edu/?path=/docs/foundation-animations--docs).

## Cascade layers

NDT4 layer order:

```css
@layer base, theme, utilities, print, site;
```

- Theme ships styles in `base`, `theme`, `utilities`, and `print`.
- **`site` is reserved for this project’s custom CSS.** Put all overrides inside `@layer site { … }`.
- Do not fight theme specificity outside `@layer site`.

## Tokens

Prefer CSS custom properties from the theme, for example:

- Brand: `--brand-blue`, `--brand-gold`, `--brand-green`, `--sky-blue`, `--warm-white`, `--link-blue`
- Fonts: `--font-default` (GP / Polaris), `--font-heading` (Garamond-Pro)
- Layout: `--grid-gap`, gutter variables

Background utilities use `.bg--{token}`, plus `.bg--full-bleed`, `.bg--gradient`, `.bg--transparent`, `.bg--to-*` direction modifiers. Support light/dark via `data-theme` / `.mode--dark` as provided by the theme.

## Breakpoints (mobile-first)

| Token | Min width |
|-------|-----------|
| xs | default (&lt; 480px) — no media query |
| sm | ≥ 30em (480px) |
| md | ≥ 48em (768px) |
| ml | ≥ 60em (960px) |
| lg | ≥ 80em (1280px) |
| xl | ≥ 90em (1440px) |
| xxl | ≥ 100em (1600px) |

Write custom media queries in the same mobile-first style.

## Animations

- Include `animate.css` only when using motion classes.
- Prefer `.animate` + `.animate--fade-in*` / `.animate--move-*`.
- Keep motion short and purposeful; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
